  "Question": "In \\(\\triangle ABC\\), \\(AB=AC\\). Points \\(D\\) and \\(E\\) lie on \\(AB\\) and \\(AC\\), respectively, and \\(AD=AE\\). If \\(BE=6\\), find the length of \\(CD\\).",
